# Build-context hygiene for packages/m3l-console-{server,web}/Dockerfile
# (ADR-0071, X12/issue #560) — both COPY the whole repo (`context: .`) so
# the workspace's `workspace:*` dependency graph resolves during
# `pnpm install`. This excludes what the builder stage regenerates itself,
# or what has no business inside a build context at all.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.github
.claude
data
tmp
docs
*.log
.DS_Store

# Both Dockerfiles COPY the whole build context; a local secret file must
# never ride along even though it's gitignored (`.gitignore`'s documented
# home for NPM_TOKEN/GITHUB_TOKEN-shaped values) — Vite's default envDir
# would otherwise inline any VITE_-prefixed .env value straight into the
# nginx image's static bundle.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.npmrc
